      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "九年，世子始開征虜府，補邵錄事參軍，轉號中軍，遷諮議參軍，領記室。",
      "reading": "義熙九年劉義符建府，邵補錄事參軍，後諮議參軍兼記室。",
      "note": "義熙九年劉義符建府，邵補錄事參軍，後諮議參軍兼記室。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 102,
      "end_codepoint": 135,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "十二年，武帝北伐，邵請見，曰：「人生危脆，必當遠慮。",
      "reading": "義熙十二年劉裕北伐，邵求見請早作遠慮。",
      "note": "義熙十二年劉裕北伐，邵求見請早作遠慮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 26,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-26",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "穆之若邂逅不幸，誰可代之？",
      "reading": "邵問穆之若遇不幸由誰代理。",
      "note": "邵問穆之若遇不幸由誰代理。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 26,
      "end_codepoint": 39,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-39",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "尊業如此，苟有不諱，事將如何？」",
      "reading": "邵亦問劉裕本人若有不諱將如何。",
      "note": "邵亦問劉裕本人若有不諱將如何。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 39,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-55",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "帝曰：「此自委穆之及卿耳。」",
      "reading": "裕答以穆之和邵。",
      "note": "裕答以穆之和邵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 69,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-69",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "青州刺史檀祗鎮廣陵，時滁中結聚亡命，祗率眾掩之，劉穆之恐以為變，將發軍。",
      "reading": "檀祗率眾掩滁中亡命，劉穆之疑其變，將發軍。",
      "note": "檀祗率眾掩滁中亡命，劉穆之疑其變，將發軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 69,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-105",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "邵曰：「檀韶據中流，道濟為軍首，若疑狀發露，恐生大變。",
      "reading": "邵提出檀韶據中流、檀道濟掌軍的情勢。",
      "note": "邵提出檀韶據中流、檀道濟掌軍的情勢。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 105,
      "end_codepoint": 132,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-132",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "宜且遣慰勞，以觀其意。」",
      "reading": "邵請先遣人慰勞以觀祗意。",
      "note": "邵請先遣人慰勞以觀祗意。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 132,
      "end_codepoint": 144,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-144",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "既而祗果不動。",
      "reading": "祗後並未生變。",
      "note": "祗後並未生變。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 144,
      "end_codepoint": 151,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-151",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "及穆之卒，朝廷恇懼，便欲發詔以司馬徐羨之代之，邵對曰：「今誠急病，任終在徐，且世子無專命，宜須北咨。」",
      "reading": "穆之卒，廷議即發詔命徐羨之代，邵請等待北方劉裕回覆。",
      "note": "穆之卒，廷議即發詔命徐羨之代，邵請等待北方劉裕回覆。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 151,
      "end_codepoint": 202,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-202",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "信反，方使世子出命曰：「朝廷及大府事，悉咨徐司馬，其餘啟還。」",
      "reading": "回信後劉義符發令，朝廷大府事就徐羨之諮議。",
      "note": "回信後劉義符發令，朝廷大府事就徐羨之諮議。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 202,
      "end_codepoint": 233,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-233",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "武帝重其臨事不撓，有大臣體。",
      "reading": "裕重邵臨事不撓。",
      "note": "裕重邵臨事不撓。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 233,
      "end_codepoint": 247,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-247",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "十四年，以世子鎮荊州，邵諫曰：「儲貳之重，四海所繫，不宜處外，敢以死請。」",
      "reading": "義熙十四年擬使世子鎮荊州，邵諫儲君不宜居外。",
      "note": "義熙十四年擬使世子鎮荊州，邵諫儲君不宜居外。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 247,
      "end_codepoint": 284,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence4-284",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "從之。",
      "reading": "裕聽從。",
      "note": "裕聽從。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 284,
      "end_codepoint": 287,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "文帝為中郎將、荊州刺史，以邵為司馬，領南郡相，眾事悉決於邵。",
      "reading": "劉義隆鎮荊州，以邵為司馬兼南郡相。",
      "note": "劉義隆鎮荊州，以邵為司馬兼南郡相。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 30,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence5-30",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "武帝受命，以佐命功，封臨沮伯。",
      "reading": "劉裕受禪，封邵臨沮伯。",
      "note": "劉裕受禪，封邵臨沮伯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 30,
      "end_codepoint": 45,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence5-45",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "分荊州立湘州，以邵為刺史。",
      "reading": "分荊置湘，以邵為刺史。",
      "note": "分荊置湘，以邵為刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 45,
      "end_codepoint": 58,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence5-58",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "將署府，邵以為長沙內地，非用武之國，置署妨人，乖為政要。",
      "reading": "邵認為長沙不宜增設軍府。",
      "note": "邵認為長沙不宜增設軍府。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 58,
      "end_codepoint": 86,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence5-86",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "帝從之。",
      "reading": "劉裕採納。",
      "note": "劉裕採納。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 86,
      "end_codepoint": 90,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence5-90",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "謝晦反，遺書要邵，邵不發函，馳使呈帝。",
      "reading": "謝晦反時以書邀邵，邵不啟封即使人呈宋文帝。",
      "note": "謝晦反時以書邀邵，邵不啟封即使人呈宋文帝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 90,
      "end_codepoint": 109,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "元嘉五年，轉征虜將軍，領寧蠻校尉、雍州刺史，加都督。",
      "reading": "元嘉五年轉征虜將軍兼寧蠻校尉、雍州刺史，加都督。",
      "note": "元嘉五年轉征虜將軍兼寧蠻校尉、雍州刺史，加都督。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 26,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-26",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "初，王華與邵有隙，及華參要，親舊為之危心。",
      "reading": "王華與邵有隙，華參政後親舊為邵擔憂。",
      "note": "王華與邵有隙，華參政後親舊為邵擔憂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 26,
      "end_codepoint": 47,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-47",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "邵曰：「子陵方弘至公，必不以私讎害正義。」",
      "reading": "邵稱王華字子陵，相信其不以私害公。",
      "note": "邵稱王華字子陵，相信其不以私害公。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 47,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-68",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "是任也，華實舉之。",
      "reading": "本次任命確由華薦舉。",
      "note": "本次任命確由華薦舉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "及至襄陽，築長圍，修立隄堰，開田數千頃，郡人賴之富贍。",
      "reading": "邵到襄陽築圍、修堰，開田數千頃。",
      "note": "邵到襄陽築圍、修堰，開田數千頃。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 104,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-104",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "丹、淅二川蠻屢為寇，邵誘其帥，因大會誅之，悉掩其徒黨。",
      "reading": "丹、淅二川武裝屢侵，邵誘其首領於會中誅之並掩其徒。",
      "note": "丹、淅二川武裝屢侵，邵誘其首領於會中誅之並掩其徒。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 104,
      "end_codepoint": 131,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-131",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "既失信羣蠻，所在並起，水陸斷絕。",
      "reading": "失信後群蠻起事，水陸斷絕。",
      "note": "失信後群蠻起事，水陸斷絕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 131,
      "end_codepoint": 147,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-147",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "子敷至襄陽定省，當還都，羣蠻伺欲取之。",
      "reading": "子敷探父後欲回都，群蠻準備截取。",
      "note": "子敷探父後欲回都，群蠻準備截取。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 147,
      "end_codepoint": 166,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence6-166",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "會蠕蠕國遣使朝貢，賊以為敷，遂執之，邵坐降號揚烈將軍。",
      "reading": "蠕蠕貢使被錯認為敷遭執，邵因而降號。",
      "note": "蠕蠕貢使被錯認為敷遭執，邵因而降號。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 166,
      "end_codepoint": 193,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence7-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "江夏王義恭鎮江陵，以邵為撫軍長史，持節、南蠻校尉。",
      "reading": "江夏王義恭鎮江陵，邵任撫軍長史、持節及南蠻校尉。",
      "note": "江夏王義恭鎮江陵，邵任撫軍長史、持節及南蠻校尉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 25,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence7-25",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "坐在雍州營私蓄聚，贓貨二百四十五萬，下廷尉，免官，削爵土。",
      "reading": "因在雍州營私、贓貨二百四十五萬，免官削爵。",
      "note": "因在雍州營私、贓貨二百四十五萬，免官削爵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 25,
      "end_codepoint": 54,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence7-54",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "後為吳興太守，卒，追復爵邑，諡曰簡伯。",
      "reading": "後任吳興太守，卒，卒後復爵邑、諡簡伯。",
      "note": "後任吳興太守，卒，卒後復爵邑、諡簡伯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 54,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence7-73",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAC",
      "source_quote": "邵臨終，遺命祭以菜果，葦蓆為轜車，諸子從焉。",
      "reading": "邵囑祭用菜果、轜車用葦蓆，諸子依命。",
      "note": "邵囑祭用菜果、轜車用葦蓆，諸子依命。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 73,
      "end_codepoint": 95,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:received_sentence7-95",
