      "raw_start": 2608,
      "raw_end": 2681,
      "source_quote": "<ref>張邵字茂宗　李慈銘宋書札記云：「宋書張邵傳本亡，後人雜取南史等書補之，故邵子敷，兄子暢，皆別有傳，而此卷邵傳後復重出敷傳。」</ref>",
      "note": "錄作校者按語。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p001"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu046-ws2118581.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2118581,
      "line": 46,
      "raw_start": 3187,
      "raw_end": 3239,
      "source_quote": "<ref>時滁中結聚亡命　「滁中」各本並作「滁州」，據南史改。按時無「滁州」，當作「滁中」。</ref>",
      "note": "錄作校者按語。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p004"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu046-ws2118581.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2118581,
      "line": 50,
      "raw_start": 3666,
      "raw_end": 3726,
      "source_quote": "<ref>丹淅二川蠻屢為寇　「川」各本並作「州」，按時無丹州及淅州，有丹水、淅水，「州」當作「川」，今訂正。</ref>",
      "note": "錄作校者按語。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p006"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu046-ws2118581.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2118581,
      "line": 52,
      "raw_start": 3841,
      "raw_end": 3894,
      "source_quote": "<ref>坐在雍州營私蓄聚　「聚」各本並作「取」。「蓄取」義不可通，今據通鑑宋文帝元嘉八年改。</ref>",
      "note": "錄作校者按語。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangshao-complete:p007"
